{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_chat_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_chat_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "72d3b5a1997a292574562f00a9fe9e3cf5f284e05e0a44a42bbcefa32428b84b", "ja": "あれ～？　ここにもない……。\nどこ行っちゃったのかなぁ？\n私のボールペン。", "zh": "奇怪～？也不在这里……\n到底跑到哪里去了呢？\n我的原子笔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_chat_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "540301d33fe377120651d469aa7b03970a215a7ef7d25b794c2b9a3b4f87f27a", "ja": "確か、紙を取りに立ち上がって。\nどこに置いたか忘れないように、\nペンを……", "zh": "我记得我站起来去拿纸。\n然后怕忘记笔放在哪里，\n所以就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_chat_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "09e15d5712fa1dba991c4d4df34bbd04352f5cb533fe5c2eae67891932bfd7a6", "ja": "あったぁ！　そうそう、ポッケに\nしまってたんだっけ。えへへっ、\n私ったら、しっかりしなくちゃ♪", "zh": "找到了！对对对，我收到口袋里了。\n嘿嘿，我也真是的……\n要振作一点啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_chat_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "338d409f7d463d573231acbbae90c0a23373e307576d3f5b5a59a28936935c2a", "ja": "あっ！　そういえば、社長さんも\n{$P$}Pさんを\n探してたんだ！　どこかなぁ～？", "zh": "啊！对了，社长也在找\n{$P$}P先生！\n他在哪里呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
